@tempo 86
@swing 0.60
@fx vinyl 0.34
@fx reverb 0.48
@fx lowpass 0.64
@instrument lead flute 0.76
@instrument bass upright 0.78
@instrument chord guitar 0.58

loop: 4
chords: Gmaj7 D/F# Em7 Cadd9

kick:   x . . . . . . . . . x . . . . .
        x . . . . . . x . . x . . . . .
        x . . . . . . . . . x . . x . .
